{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/c26df3ca255514c7d9500c770e5643d6.poster.avif?t=1759965340\" width=552 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/c26df3ca255514c7d9500c770e5643d6.webm?t=1759965340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/c26df3ca255514c7d9500c770e5643d6.mp4?t=1759965340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fold &amp; Fly</strong> is a game about gliding a paper plane through whimsical  dreamscapes, catching wind currents, threading narrow gaps, and collecting stars to raise your score. If you enjoy simple, satisfying games that mix relaxing vibes with fast-paced moments of flow, this one\u2019s for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/a197bfd202b639faf85e5c19be236f69.poster.avif?t=1759965340\" width=642 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/a197bfd202b639faf85e5c19be236f69.webm?t=1759965340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/a197bfd202b639faf85e5c19be236f69.mp4?t=1759965340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fold &amp; Fly</strong> is our attempt to bottle that childhood feeling of launching a paper plane and imagining it soaring forever. The controls are intuitive, the challenge ramps naturally, and the joy is in the motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/3eb3f6962f70b8dadc05235e83b845f3.poster.avif?t=1759965340\" width=732 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/3eb3f6962f70b8dadc05235e83b845f3.webm?t=1759965340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/3eb3f6962f70b8dadc05235e83b845f3.mp4?t=1759965340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll fly through vibrant handcrafted dioramas, from cardboard cliffs to floating islands, and spot glowing origami  that open portals to new worlds and exponetially, double your point. Each world is procedurally generated, so you\u2019ll always have somewhere new to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/be7313997ced2c904c60930845ce7113.poster.avif?t=1759965340\" width=732 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/be7313997ced2c904c60930845ce7113.webm?t=1759965340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/be7313997ced2c904c60930845ce7113.mp4?t=1759965340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fold &amp; Fly\u00a0</strong>features a <strong>map generator with seed input</strong> so you can create and <strong>save your favorite worlds</strong>, plus <strong>dynamic weather</strong> systems including <strong>volumetric clouds</strong>, <strong>thunderstorms</strong>, <strong>snow, fog and more</strong> to add atmosphere and challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><strong>Fold &amp; Fly</strong> is crafted by a small indie team from Montgreal, built with care, color, and a shared love for flying games. It\u2019s a focused, replayable experience designed to bring a bit of wonder into your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/f8232008e187103f47db8b32d6cd2251.poster.avif?t=1759965340\" width=582 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/f8232008e187103f47db8b32d6cd2251.webm?t=1759965340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/f8232008e187103f47db8b32d6cd2251.mp4?t=1759965340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re offering this for the price of a  coffee, and if you choose to support us, big thank you! If you have feedback, ideas, or just want to tell us how far you flew, we\u2019d love to hear from you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/9d1a6bd46eb30dcbaef37e1338a516a7.poster.avif?t=1759965340\" width=350 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/9d1a6bd46eb30dcbaef37e1338a516a7.webm?t=1759965340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/9d1a6bd46eb30dcbaef37e1338a516a7.mp4?t=1759965340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game offers you:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Intuitive, smooth flying gameplay with paper plane physics<br>\u2726 Infinite procedurally generated worlds to explore<br>\u2726 Score-chasing action: collect stars and chain near-misses<br>\u2726 Glowing origami dragonflies that summon portals to new worlds<br>\u2726 A whimsical, handcrafted  art style<br>\u2726 Easy to pick up, satisfying to master <br>\u2726 Great for quick sessions or long flow-state flights <br>\u2726 Built with care by a small indie team who really love paper planes!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":" Gateway Opener","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812280/063fec017fc7d794b06a2c7a92097a4f6de00c94.jpg"},{"name":"Interdimensional Drifter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812280/dbb9e1b3e444957bb75b2e40dd572b1bc7d2023e.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Portals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812280/dd3239bc78634d4ae8c05591e9e6bf7e03de4208.jpg"},{"name":"Stargazer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812280/aa0d78d98b4ca6fe22759f28812f980d4f3e27e2.jpg"},{"name":"Celestial Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812280/b6276b935ec84bcc990ab4cbc0879c32e82a456f.jpg"},{"name":"Bringer of LightCollected","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812280/b34df5dfea087a0a04abab1977b8ddef2747baa5.jpg"},{"name":"First-Few-Falls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812280/7a1adfddb4f59624bde8a57b2b663da3f19c5c22.jpg"},{"name":"Recyclone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812280/98699533c102becdedc65d15edeb3ad0e1052f51.jpg"},{"name":"Fallen but Unbroken","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812280/25acd7223decb86d2703f9363855bc811a9044d6.jpg"},{"name":"Wing Whisperer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunit